WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.252
Apple will not let you submit an app without

2
00:00:02.287 --> 00:00:05.561
a privacy policy URL, and Google will not publish

3
00:00:05.608 --> 00:00:07.372
you without the Data safety form.

4
00:00:07.814 --> 00:00:09.230
Here is a way to do both in a

5
00:00:09.276 --> 00:00:10.728
couple of minutes, free.

6
00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:12.411
Start with your app name,

7
00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:14.803
your company, and the email people can reach

8
00:00:14.838 --> 00:00:17.775
you at. Now tick what your app actually collects

9
00:00:17.926 --> 00:00:20.016
— email address, usage data,

10
00:00:20.109 --> 00:00:22.674
crash logs, whatever leaves the device.

11
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.520
Add the services you bundle,

12
00:00:24.637 --> 00:00:26.692
and each one gets named in the policy with

13
00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.689
a link to its own privacy terms.

14
00:00:29.293 --> 00:00:32.183
Tick GDPR and the legal bases and European

15
00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.611
rights sections appear.

16
00:00:34.053 --> 00:00:36.386
Watch the document on the right build itself

17
00:00:36.444 --> 00:00:38.940
as you go. Then open the cheat sheet:

18
00:00:39.219 --> 00:00:41.785
it tells you exactly which data types to select

19
00:00:41.831 --> 00:00:44.548
in App Store Connect, what counts as tracking,

20
00:00:44.664 --> 00:00:46.638
and what to answer in Play Console.

21
00:00:47.149 --> 00:00:49.285
Download it as HTML and host it.

22
00:00:49.726 --> 00:00:52.060
Nothing you typed left this browser tab.
